#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:4 366a188b50634c0ca71ecba7bd12864c
msgid "配额申请"
msgstr "Quota Request"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:8 88e50e4eb7494f77b280098a8f942c27
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:10 06a9acaa70bb490581149337d29da2b8
msgid ""
"当默认配额（CPU/存储）不足、或需要申请项目组级别的额外资源时，使用 本流程提交"
"配额申请。管理员审批通过后，配额会自动到账。"
msgstr ""
"When default quotas (CPU/storage) are insufficient, or you need additional "
"project-group-level resources, use this workflow to submit a quota request. "
"After administrator approval, the quota is applied automatically."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:14 f5aba06f863a4f4d9fe06e6d81caccd1
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to Access"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:16 a5438a0c09884f9e8fe6f800fcc89c36
msgid ""
"点击左侧菜单 ``配额申请``，进入配额申请页面。普通用户侧栏默认包含 此菜单。"
msgstr ""
"Click ``Quota Request`` in the left menu to open the quota request page. "
"This menu is included in the default sidebar for regular users."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:20 514f0294b979406ca33750951538130e
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page Overview"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:22 d2086b5ace954f9e96ad9c31856e0ce6
msgid ""
"页面顶部是 ``我的申请`` 标签，标签右侧有两个按钮：``刷新`` 和 ``新建 申请``。"
"点击 ``刷新`` 重新载入列表；点击 ``新建申请`` 弹出申请表单。"
msgstr ""
"At the top is the ``My Requests`` tab with ``Refresh`` and ``New Request`` "
"buttons on the right. Click ``Refresh`` to reload the list; click ``New "
"Request`` to open the request form."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:25 72b2ad4ce30f45b7a99225f5603e130a
msgid ""
"标签下方是申请列表表格，列包含：``申请编号``、``申请人``、``所属项目``、 ``申"
"请金额``、``期望CPU核数``、``期望存储``、``申请理由``、``状态``、 ``提交时间"
"``。"
msgstr ""
"Below the tab is a request list table with columns: ``Request ID``, "
"``Applicant``, ``Project``, ``Requested Amount``, ``Requested CPU Cores``, "
"``Requested Storage``, ``Reason``, ``Status``, and ``Submitted At``."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:33 73954a3cb6eb453fa34c236a09387c30
msgid "配额申请页面"
msgstr "Quota request page"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:33 50e1b1b283014dddb0f7f1d499503612
msgid ""
"配额申请页面，含 ``我的申请`` 标签、``刷新`` 和 ``新建申请`` 按钮、 申请列表"
"表格。"
msgstr ""
"Quota request page with the ``My Requests`` tab, ``Refresh`` and ``New "
"Request`` buttons, and the request list table."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:37 c9ae75bda5214494ba0388c5257361da
msgid "新建申请流程"
msgstr "New Request Workflow"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:39 790db9fcb6624ace8c5da6666633aa07
msgid "在配额申请页面点击 ``新建申请`` 按钮，弹出 ``新建配额申请`` 表单。"
msgstr ""
"On the quota request page, click ``New Request`` to open the ``New Quota "
"Request`` form."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:40 b5d76b2d948e486bad59bf4c519b829d
msgid "填写表单字段："
msgstr "Fill in the form fields:"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:42 ad53de1abc0d460f970e5a934a89067f
msgid "``申请金额（元）``：必填，希望申请的资源金额（单位：元）。"
msgstr ""
"``Requested Amount (CNY)``: Required. The resource amount you wish to "
"request (in yuan)."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:43 410bec5fd3b848208168d778d3dfcced
msgid ""
"``期望 CPU 配额（核数，可选）``：希望获得的 CPU 核数（如不填则 仅申请金额）。"
msgstr ""
"``Requested CPU Quota (cores, optional)``: Desired CPU core count (leave "
"blank to request amount only)."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:45 f641b399bbb94a1f991e66de022b63df
msgid ""
"``期望存储空间（可选）``：希望获得的存储空间，单位 GB（如不填 则仅申请金"
"额）。"
msgstr ""
"``Requested Storage (optional)``: Desired storage in GB (leave blank to "
"request amount only)."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:47 6bcdec5de53e47a0989aa4c78c7857f5
msgid "``所属项目组（可选）``：下拉选择项目组；不填则为个人申请。"
msgstr ""
"``Project Group (optional)``: Select a project group from the dropdown; "
"leave blank for a personal request."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:48 cefab859bfe74be9ad82b6d8d9862068
msgid ""
"``申请理由``：必填，简要说明申请原因，例如：因 XX 项目数据量 大，需要额外存储"
"空间。"
msgstr ""
"``Reason``: Required. Briefly explain why you need the quota, for example: "
"project XX has large data volume and needs additional storage."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:51 c3831e6f12c7415c8a525019a5e80008
msgid "确认无误后点击 ``提 交`` 按钮；如放弃可点击 ``取 消``。"
msgstr "Click ``Submit`` when ready, or ``Cancel`` to discard."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:52 06b51bd233c84e6a9356f50ae5786c43
msgid ""
"看到提交成功提示后，新申请出现在 ``我的申请`` 列表中，状态为 ``待审批``。"
msgstr ""
"After a successful submission, the new request appears in ``My Requests`` "
"with status ``Pending Approval``."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:59 35ad26d44eaa402cab0ba6f74202ebff
msgid "新建配额申请表单"
msgstr "New quota request form"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:59 b7f7785717db4429821006ff1f3882ce
msgid ""
"新建配额申请表单，含申请金额、CPU 配额、存储空间、所属项目组、 申请理由字段。"
msgstr ""
"New quota request form with amount, CPU quota, storage, project group, and "
"reason fields."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:63 110fb177b5764bd7a9ebc3411ee2303e
msgid "查看申请状态"
msgstr "Check Request Status"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:65 d3002c5ac1fa40029766557e39b6049e
msgid "申请提交后，状态会自动流转："
msgstr "After submission, status progresses automatically:"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:67 230ac5c57fbc471999682ff8b36bef3c
msgid "``待审批``：申请已提交，等待管理员审核。"
msgstr "``Pending Approval``: Submitted and awaiting administrator review."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:68 ad381009a4c440168d4f2cd830b410e9
msgid "``已通过``：申请通过，相应配额已到账。"
msgstr "``Approved``: Approved; the quota has been applied."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:69 22c56a719f674698919199fd78fa1d20
msgid "``已驳回``：申请未通过，可在申请列表查看驳回原因。"
msgstr "``Rejected``: Not approved; view the reason in the request list."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:72 49fe3491c3ff4dd0927ea4595ef543c0
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:76 51a69a60ed2f4bb19bbc3ff358fcc136
msgid "申请提交后不可直接修改，如需调整参数可联系管理员驳回后重新提 交。"
msgstr ""
"Requests cannot be edited after submission. To change parameters, ask an "
"administrator to reject the request and submit again."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:78 b57217e14d73445787503997d50309af
msgid ""
"``申请金额`` 和 ``申请理由`` 是必填字段，其他字段选填；不填 的字段表示不申请"
"该项资源。"
msgstr ""
"``Requested Amount`` and ``Reason`` are required; other fields are optional. "
"Blank fields mean you are not requesting that resource type."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:80 8561506100e74cf88cfe6931c41f3756
msgid ""
"资源到账需要时间，请耐心等待管理员审批；如长时间未处理，可提 交工单询问。"
msgstr ""
"Quota application takes time. Wait for administrator approval; if there is "
"no response for a long time, submit a ticket to inquire."

#: ../../docs/data/quota.rst:85 dec87a259e6844748962e627d384c29f
msgid "请如实填写申请金额和理由。频繁申请小额资源可能被管理员驳回。"
msgstr ""
"Provide accurate amounts and reasons. Frequent small requests may be "
"rejected by administrators."
